        <section>6.3 Maturity Scoring</section>
        <snippet>Score 0.0-0.2 Raw, 0.2-0.4 Early, 0.4-0.6 Partial (minimum for phase gate), 0.6-0.8 Solid (ready for downstream), 0.8-1.0 Ready. Planning to Solutioning gate requires PRD at maturity >= 0.6, requirements at >= 0.4.</snippet>
      </doc>
